      "result_applied_to": "68117",
      "match_notes": "Roche won the toss and decided to bat first in a game reduced to 40 overs a side, Roche scored 186 a/o, A Leaney 76, D Williams 29 and T Hall 27 with the runs, T Leveson 5-43, B Hutchings 2-18 and R Walter 2-35 with the wickets.<br>In reply Holsworthy reached 50 before losing their first wicket, and were going well, until Roche took 4 wickets in 2 overs, and then picked up wickets regularly to reduce Holsworthy to 171 a/o, O Sleeman 3-25, M Trudgeon 2-19, L Oakley 2-26 and D Williams 2-32 taking the wickets for Roche.",
